WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.038
That is the full demo.

00:00:01.088 --> 00:00:04.894
The platform is defined in code, every change goes through a pull request with

00:00:04.944 --> 00:00:07.959
checks, and every production deployment waits for an approval.

00:00:08.009 --> 00:00:11.716
Azure Monitor watches the cluster, and Azure Policy enforces the guardrails.

00:00:11.766 --> 00:00:15.621
The guide, the code and the workflows are in one GitHub repository that you can

00:00:15.671 --> 00:00:16.610
reuse as a template.
